    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "b5b83f31_b3fb8ef9",
        "filename": "ssh/agent/client.go",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 76,
      "author": {
        "id": 29401
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-09-29T19:56:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You\u0027re right that this was unclear, and upon further inspection this PR wasn\u0027t actually handling it completely correctly. I\u0027ve made it clear now that if extensions are unsupported the sentinel ErrAgentExtensionUnsupported error should be returned in which case the library will handle returning the correct error code.",
      "parentUuid": "f3161952_1039dcf8",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 76,
        "startChar": 12,
        "endLine": 76,
        "endChar": 41
      },
      "revId": "ef52574fb427a2ffba1296a590479cfa4a9b462e",
      "serverId": "62eb7196-b449-3ce5-99f1-c037f21e1705",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "675a899e_f5c1beba",
        "filename": "ssh/agent/client.go",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 78,
      "author": {
        "id": 5893
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-09-24T14:01:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I couldn\u0027t readily  see where the output format for extensions is defined in the spec.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 78,
        "startChar": 7,
        "endLine": 78,
        "endChar": 16
      },
      "revId": "ef52574fb427a2ffba1296a590479cfa4a9b462e",
      "serverId": "62eb7196-b449-3ce5-99f1-c037f21e1705",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "17d9d6b2_99ff6b31",
        "filename": "ssh/agent/client.go",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 78,
      "author": {
        "id": 29401
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-09-29T19:56:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Added some clarification here. For better or worse the spec leaves this totally open-ended: \"The contents of successful extension reply messages are specific to the extension type.  Extension requests may return SSH_AGENT_SUCCESS on success or some other extension-specific message.\" Since the type of the message isn\u0027t even specified we can\u0027t even try and parse it beyond looking for message type bytes that indicate an error. So my solution was to just return the whole response including the message type byte.",
      "parentUuid": "675a899e_f5c1beba",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 78,
        "startChar": 7,
        "endLine": 78,
        "endChar": 16
      },
      "revId": "ef52574fb427a2ffba1296a590479cfa4a9b462e",
      "serverId": "62eb7196-b449-3ce5-99f1-c037f21e1705",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "080deea7_ec44a2d2",
        "filename": "ssh/agent/client.go",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 206,
      "author": {
        "id": 5893
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-09-24T14:01:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "this needs to be public so others can implement it. \n\nalternatively, define an error sentinel value (\"ErrAgentUnsupported\" ?) that gets translated into code 28 by the library. \n\nThe latter is more idiomatic, probably.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 206,
        "startChar": 6,
        "endLine": 206,
        "endChar": 27
      },
      "revId": "ef52574fb427a2ffba1296a590479cfa4a9b462e",
      "serverId": "62eb7196-b449-3ce5-99f1-c037f21e1705",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "ca2b252c_86e47c23",
        "filename": "ssh/agent/client.go",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 206,
      "author": {
        "id": 29401
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-09-29T19:56:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right, as mentioned above I\u0027ve now clarified that implementations of the Extension method should return the sentinel ErrAgentExtensionUnsupported error, and then the library will translate this into the proper message code.",
      "parentUuid": "080deea7_ec44a2d2",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 206,
        "startChar": 6,
        "endLine": 206,
        "endChar": 27
      },
      "revId": "ef52574fb427a2ffba1296a590479cfa4a9b462e",
